From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:48:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] vrend: release external EGL bookkeeping without GBM

An externally supplied EGL display is available independently of GBM. Keep its wrapper cleanup under the EGL header guard, matching initialization, so every renderer teardown frees the non-owning wrapper on Apple hosts without terminating their shared display.
---
 src/vrend/vrend_winsys.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/vrend/vrend_winsys.c b/src/vrend/vrend_winsys.c
index d4c9b9e09796cb8be3cc79831f2c18400f50dd0b..47859037861feaa5dc1d126ff9d755c6ec757c64 100644
--- a/src/vrend/vrend_winsys.c
+++ b/src/vrend/vrend_winsys.c
@@ -107,7 +107,10 @@ void vrend_winsys_cleanup(void)
          virgl_gbm_fini(gbm);
          gbm = NULL;
       }
-   } else if (use_context == CONTEXT_EGL_EXTERNAL) {
+   }
+#endif
+#ifdef HAVE_EPOXY_EGL_H
+   if (use_context == CONTEXT_EGL_EXTERNAL) {
       free(egl);
       egl = NULL;
       use_context = CONTEXT_NONE;
